{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your own deck </strong>of strategies with soldiers, items, and spells</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose powerful passive spells</strong> that grant bonuses and enhancements during each run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rogue-lite progression</strong> with soldier leveling and meta upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple modes, including a hands-off AFK mode</strong> for idle play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Direct your soldiers </strong> as they hold the line and defend the shrine </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Create crazy builds and push your limit in AFK mode.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with soldiers and items to forge unstoppable squads, then let AFK mode push them beyond their limits. Discover how far your wildest synergies can really go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679750/extras/c78c1d66c87dc721c4802bb8b7297281.poster.avif?t=1755801658\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679750/extras/c78c1d66c87dc721c4802bb8b7297281.webm?t=1755801658\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679750/extras/c78c1d66c87dc721c4802bb8b7297281.mp4?t=1755801658\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Blend of army management with rogue-lite depth.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this strategic roguelite tower defense, every unit and item choice shapes your path to victory. Assemble a squad of soldiers, stack synergizing upgrades, and adapt on the fly as enemies grow stronger. Build clever combos, push your army to its limits, and discover countless ways to dominate the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679750/extras/2dc60ed74fa5789d0b66c084ae8ff5e6.poster.avif?t=1755801658\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679750/extras/2dc60ed74fa5789d0b66c084ae8ff5e6.webm?t=1755801658\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679750/extras/2dc60ed74fa5789d0b66c084ae8ff5e6.mp4?t=1755801658\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Meta upgrades</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meta upgrades provide permanent boosts for your soldiers and spells, carrying over between runs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679750/extras/4326ca3ba150e92afa0a9bdc1515693d.avif?t=1755801658\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3679750?t=1755801658","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679750/3680acea0bf905bbec2d808b68639c8967b210d1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755801658","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679750/921d052fda9585d88c06a25792f18d254089cbc5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755801658","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679750/921d052fda9585d88c06a25792f18d254089cbc5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755801658","categories":[{"descriptio